{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jer-5-1","title":"Jeremiah 5:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The judgments of God upon the Jews, for their perverseness; 7 for their adultery; 10 for their impiety; 15 for their worship of idols; 19 for their contempt of God; 25 and for their great corruption in the civil state; 30 and ecclesiastical.</p>\n<p>Run ye. 2Ch 16:9; Da 12:4; Joe 2:9; Am 8:12; Zec 2:4 seek. Pr 8:3; So 3:2; Lu 14:21 if ye can. 1Ki 19:10; Pr 20:6; Eze 22:30 if there. Ge 18:23-32; Ps 12:1; 14:3; 53:2-4; Mic 7:1,2 that seeketh. Pr 2:4-6; 23:23; Isa 59:4,14,15; 2Th 2:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-2","title":"Jeremiah 5:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>though. 4:2; 7:9; Le 19:12; Isa 48:1; Ho 4:1,2,15; 10:4; Zec 5:3,4; Mal 3:5 1Ti 1:10; 2Ti 3:5; Tit 1:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-3","title":"Jeremiah 5:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>are not thine. 32:19; 2Ch 16:9; Ps 11:4-7; 51:6; Pr 22:12; Ro 2:2 thou hast stricken. 2:30; 7:28; 2Ch 28:22; Pr 23:35; 27:22; Isa 1:5,6; 9:13; 42:25 Eze 24:13; Zep 3:1,2,7 they have made. Pr 21:29; Isa 48:4; Eze 3:7-9; Zec 7:11,12; Ro 2:4,5; Heb 12:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-4","title":"Jeremiah 5:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>4:22; 7:8; 8:7; Isa 27:11; 28:9-13; Ho 4:6; Mt 11:5; Joh 7:48,49</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-5","title":"Jeremiah 5:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>get me. Am 4:1; Mic 3:1; Mal 2:7 but these. 6:13; Ps 2:2,3; Eze 22:6-8,25-29; Mic 3:1-4,11; 7:3,4; Zep 3:3-5 Mt 19:23-26; Lu 18:24; 19:14; Ac 4:26,27; Jas 2:5-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-6","title":"Jeremiah 5:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>a lion. 2:15; 4:7; 25:38; 49:19; Eze 14:16-21; Da 7:4; Ho 5:14; 13:7,8 Am 5:18,19; Na 2:11,12 and a wolf. Ps 104:20; Eze 22:27; Hab 1:8; Zep 3:3 evenings. or, deserts. a leopard. Da 7:6; Ho 13:7; Re 13:2 because. 2:17,19; 9:12-14; 14:7; 16:10-12; 30:24; Nu 32:14; Ezr 9:6; 10:10 Isa 59:12; La 1:5; Eze 16:25; 23:19 increased. Heb. strong.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-7","title":"Jeremiah 5:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>How shall. 3:19; Ho 11:8; Mt 23:37,38 sworn by. 12:16; Jos 23:7; Ho 4:15; Am 8:14; Zep 1:5 no gods. 2:11; De 32:21; 1Co 8:4; Ga 4:8 I had fed. 2:31; De 32:15; Eze 16:49,50; Ho 13:6; Jas 5:1-5 they then. 9:2; 13:27; 23:10; 29:22,23; Le 20:10; Ps 50:18; Eze 22:11 Ho 4:2,13,14; 7:4; Mal 3:5; 1Co 6:9; Heb 13:4; Jas 4:4 by troops. Nu 25:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-8","title":"Jeremiah 5:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>every one. 13:27; Ge 39:9; Ex 20:14,17; De 5:18,21; 2Sa 11:2-4; Job 31:9 Mt 5:27,28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-9","title":"Jeremiah 5:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>I not visit. 29; 9:9; 23:2; La 4:22; Ho 2:13; 8:13 and shall. 44:22; Le 26:25; De 32:35,43; Isa 1:24; Eze 5:13-15; 7:9; Na 1:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-10","title":"Jeremiah 5:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>ye up. 6:4-6; 25:9; 39:8; 51:20-23; 2Ki 24:2-4; 2Ch 36:17; Isa 10:5-7 Isa 13:1-5; Eze 9:5-7; 14:17; Mt 22:7 but make. 18; 4:27; 30:11; 46:28; Eze 12:16; Am 9:8 they are not. 7:4-12; Ps 78:61,62; Ho 1:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-11","title":"Jeremiah 5:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>the house. 3:6-11,20; Isa 48:8; Ho 5:7; 6:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-12","title":"Jeremiah 5:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>have belied. 31; 4:10; 14:13,14; 23:14-17; 28:15-17; 43:2,3; De 29:19; 1Sa 6:9 2Ch 36:16; Isa 28:14,15; Eze 12:22-28; 13:6; Mic 2:11; 3:11 Hab 1:5,6; 1Jo 5:10 neither. 23:17; 28:4; Ps 10:6; 1Th 5:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-13","title":"Jeremiah 5:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>the prophets. 14:13,15; 18:18; 20:8-11; 28:3; Job 6:26; 8:2; Ho 9:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-14","title":"Jeremiah 5:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>I will make. 1:9; 23:29; 28:15-17; 2Ki 1:10-14; Ho 6:5; Zec 1:6; Re 11:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-15","title":"Jeremiah 5:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>I will. 1:15; 4:16; 6:22; 25:9; De 28:49; Isa 5:26; 29:3,6 O house. 11; 2:26; 9:26; Isa 5:7; Eze 18:31; Mt 3:9,10 a mighty. Da 2:37,38; 7:7; Hab 1:5-10 a nation. Isa 28:11; 33:19; 1Co 14:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-16","title":"Jeremiah 5:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Ps 5:9; Isa 5:28; Ro 3:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-17","title":"Jeremiah 5:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>And they. Le 26:16; De 28:30,31,33; Jud 6:3,4; Isa 62:9; 65:22; Hab 3:17,18 they shall impoverish. 1:15; 4:7,26; La 2:2; Eze 36:4; Zep 3:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-18","title":"Jeremiah 5:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>I will not make. 10; 4:27; Eze 9:8; 11:13; Ro 11:1-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-19","title":"Jeremiah 5:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Wherefore. 2:35; 13:22; 16:10; 22:8,9; De 29:24-28; 1Ki 9:8,9; 2Ch 7:21,22 Like as. 2:13; De 4:25-28; 28:47,48; La 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-21","title":"Jeremiah 5:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>O foolish. 4; 4:22; 8:7; 10:8; De 29:4; 32:6; Ps 94:8; Isa 6:9,10; 27:11 Isa 44:18; Eze 12:2; Mt 13:13-15; Joh 12:40; Ac 28:26; Ro 11:8 understanding. Heb. heart. Pr 17:16; Ho 7:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-22","title":"Jeremiah 5:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>Fear ye not. 10:7; De 28:58; Ps 119:120; Mt 10:28; Lu 12:5; Re 15:4 tremble. Ps 99:1; 119:120; Isa 66:5; Da 6:26 placed. Job 26:10; 38:10,11; Ps 33:7; 93:3,4; 104:9; Pr 8:29; Isa 50:2 Am 9:6; Na 1:4; Mr 4:39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-23","title":"Jeremiah 5:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>a revolting. 5; 6:28; 17:9; Ps 95:10; Isa 1:5; 31:6; Ho 4:8; 11:7; Heb 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-24","title":"Jeremiah 5:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>Let us now. 22; 50:5; Isa 64:7; Ho 3:5; 6:1 that giveth. 14:22; De 11:13,14; 28:12; 1Ki 17:1; Job 5:10; 36:27,28; 38:37 Ps 147:8; Joe 2:23; Am 4:7; Zec 10:1; Mt 5:45; Ac 14:17; Jas 5:7 Jas 5:17,18; Re 11:6 the appointed. Ge 8:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-25","title":"Jeremiah 5:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>2:17-19; 3:3; De 28:23,24; Ps 107:17,34; Isa 59:2; La 3:39; 4:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-26","title":"Jeremiah 5:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>For. 4:22; Isa 58:1; Eze 22:2-12 lay wait. or, pry as fowlers lie in wait. 18:22; 1Sa 19:10,11; Ps 10:9,10; 64:5; Pr 1:11,17,18; Hab 1:14,15 catch. Lu 5:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-27","title":"Jeremiah 5:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>cage. or, coop.This is, without doubt, a reference to a decoy or trap-cage, as Dr. Blayney renders; in which fowlers place several tame birds, to decoy the others into the snare prepared for them.</p>\n<p>Re 18:2 so are. Pr 1:11-13; Ho 12:7,8; Am 8:4-6; Mic 1:12; 6:10,11; Hab 2:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-28","title":"Jeremiah 5:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>waxen. De 32:15; Job 15:27,28; 21:23,24; Ps 73:6,7,12; 119:70; Am 4:1 Jas 5:4,5 overpass. 2:33; Eze 5:6,7; 16:47-52; 1Co 5:1 judge. 22:15-19; Job 29:12-14; Ps 72:4; 82:2-4; Isa 1:23; Zec 7:10 yet. 12:1; Job 12:6; Ps 73:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-29","title":"Jeremiah 5:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>9; 9:9; Mal 3:5; Jas 5:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-30","title":"Jeremiah 5:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>A wonderful and horrible thing. or, Astonishment andfilthiness. 2:12; 23:14; Isa 1:2; Ho 6:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-5-31","title":"Jeremiah 5:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>prophets. 14:14; 23:25,26; La 2:14; Eze 13:6; Mic 3:11; Mt 7:15-17 2Co 11:13-15; 2Pe 2:1,2 bear rule. or, take into their hands. my people. Isa 30:10,11; Mic 2:6,11; Joh 3:19-21; 2Th 2:9-11; 2Ti 4:3,4 and what. 4:30,31; 22:22,23; De 32:29; Isa 10:3; 20:6; 33:14; La 1:9; Eze 22:14 Zep 2:2,3</p>"}]}